# DEC - Decrement Memory
# Indexed: 0x6A, Extended: 0x7A

---
name: indexed
memory: 6A 10
setup: x=1000
at 1010: 05
expect: N=0 Z=0 V=0
expect_at 1010: 04
cycles: 6

---
name: extended to zero
memory: 7A 12 34
at 1234: 01
expect: N=0 Z=1 V=0
expect_at 1234: 00
cycles: 6

---
name: decrement 0x80 sets overflow
memory: 7A 12 34
at 1234: 80
expect: N=0 Z=0 V=1
expect_at 1234: 7F
cycles: 6
